ing\",\"format\":\"date-time\",\"description\":\"Le temps de rÃ©initialisation des limites.\"}}}},\"securitySchemes\":{\"BearerAuth\":{\"type\":\"http\",\"scheme\":\"bearer\",\"bearerFormat\":\"JWT\"}}},\"security\":[{\"BearerAuth\":[]}]}',0,0),
